# Public Supabase settings baked into the client bundle at build time (Vite loads this for `astro build`).
# Both values are PUBLIC by design: the anon key (role "anon") can only call the four SECURITY DEFINER RPCs
# (submit_quote_audit, request_independent_quote, submit_partner_application, subscribe_newsletter).
# RLS is on for every lead table, and anon has no SELECT/INSERT grants, so the key cannot read or write tables directly.
# NEVER put the service-role key or any other secret in this file.
